<title>FRANCE: BIC shares fall after results.</title>
<headline>BIC shares fall after results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in BIC fell in afternoon trading on Wednesday in the wake of first-half results which came in below analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>Analysts said, however, that the profit weakness was due largely to a commercial relaunch policy.</p>
<p>The share was down 2.81 percent at 692 francs at 1405 GMT with about 150,000 shares traded.</p>
<p>The group said on Tuesday evening that first half net attributable profit came in at 339 million francs versus 310 million the same time last year.</p>
</text>
